        <td width="692" valign="top"><br/>
            <table width="750" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                    <td width="750" class="pageName">
                        <p class="style77">ICSE SC Documents</p>
                        <p class="bodyText">The following documents contain useful information for members of ICSE
                            Organization and Program Committees. These documents embody significant ICSE corporate
                            knowledge to support ICSE continuity. More corporate ICSE knowledge can be found under <a
                                    href="http://icse-conferences.org/organization.html">Organizing ICSE.</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2024/ICSE-2024-SC-Strategic-Discussions.pdf"
                                               class="style1">ICSE 2024 SC Strategic Discussions (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2019/ICSE2019-PC-Chairs-Report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE
                            2019 PC Chairs Report by Bultan and Whittle (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2018/ICSE2018-PC-Chairs-Report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE
                            2018 PC Chairs Report by Chechik, Harman, Zimmerman and Crnkovic (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2017/ICSE2017-ChairsReport-TechnicalTrack-v1.0.pdf"
                                               class="style1">ICSE 2017 Report on the Technical Track V1.0 by Orso,
                            Robillard and Zimmermann (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2017/ICSE-PC-Chairs-Guiding-Document-1.1.pdf"
                                               class="style1">ICSE PC Chairs Guiding Document 1.1 by Canfora, Chechik,
                            Cleland-Huang, van der Hoek, Robillard, Visser and Whittle (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2016/ICSE2016-Technical-Track-Report-Visser-Williams.pdf"
                                               class="style1">ICSE 2016 Insights and Lessons Learned from Analyzing ICSE
                            2016 by Visser and Williams (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2015/ICSE2015-Technical-Track-Report-Canfora-Elbaum.pdf"
                                               class="style1">ICSE 2015 Report on Technical Track by Canfora and Elbaum
                            (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2014/ICSE-2014-PC-Chairs-Report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE
                            2014 Insights and Lessons Learned from Analyzing ICSE 2014 by Briand and van der Hoek
                            (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2008/icse2008-workshop-report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE 2008
                            Workshop Report by Engels and M&uuml;ller (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2005/icse2005-final-report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE 2005
                            Final Report by Gruia-Catalin Roman (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2001/icse2001-final-report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE 2001
                            Final Report by M&uuml;ller, Harrold and Sch&auml;fer (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2001/icse2001-postmortem.pdf" class="style1">ICSE 2001
                            Postmortem Report slides M&uuml;ller, Harrold and Sch&auml;fer (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2000/icse2000-final-report.pdf" class="style1">ICSE 2000
                            Final Report by Kevin Ryan (PDF)</a></p>
                        <p class="bodyText"><a href="sc/ICSE/2000/organizing-workshops.html" class="style1">ICSE 2000
                            Workshop Organization by Antonia Bertolino and Gail Murphy (HTML)</a></p>
                    </td>
